# HermesFace Deployment Record

## Cloudflare Worker (Telegram Proxy)
- Worker Name: tg-proxy-hm
- Worker URL: https://tg-proxy-hm.hm-22c.workers.dev
- Purpose: Bypass HF Spaces outbound firewall for Telegram Bot API

## Deployment Date
2026-06-25

## HF Space Configuration
Set these secrets in HuggingFace Space Settings → Repository secrets:

1. HF_TOKEN (required) - HuggingFace token with write permission
2. AUTO_CREATE_DATASET=true (recommended) - Auto-create backup dataset
3. OPENROUTER_API_KEY (recommended) - OpenRouter API key for 200+ models
4. TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN (optional) - Your Telegram bot token from @BotFather
5. TELEGRAM_API_BASE=https://tg-proxy-hm.hm-22c.workers.dev (optional) - Use CF proxy for Telegram

